var e={"ca-1th-5-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`In all things give thanks for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus concerning you all.`]},"ca-col-4-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be instant in prayer: watching in it with thanksgiving.`]},"ca-col-3-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`And let the peace of Christ rejoice in your hearts, wherein also you are called in one body: and be ye thankful.`]},"ca-phil-4-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be nothing solicitous: but in every thing, by prayer and supplication, with thanksgiving, let your petitions be made known to God.`]},"ca-eph-5-20":{e:`drc`,t:[`Giving thanks always for all things, in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, to God and the Father:`]},"ca-ps-107-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Give glory to the Lord, for he is good: for his mercy endureth for ever.`],r:[106,1,1]},"ca-mic-6-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`I will shew thee, O man, what is good, and what the Lord requireth of thee: Verily to do judgment, and to love mercy, and to walk solicitous with thy God.`]},"ca-phil-2-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let nothing be done through contention: neither by vain glory. But in humility, let each esteem others better than themselves:`]},"ca-sir-3-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`The greater thou art, the more humble thyself in all things, and thou shalt find grace before God:`],r:[3,20,20]},"ca-jas-4-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be humbled in the sight of the Lord: and he will exalt you.`]},"ca-matt-11-29":{e:`drc`,t:[`Take up my yoke upon you, and learn of me, because I am meek, and humble of heart: And you shall find rest to your souls.`]},"ca-luke-14-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Because every one that exalteth himself shall be humbled: and he that humbleth himself shall be exalted.`]},"ca-john-16-33":{e:`drc`,t:[`These things I have spoken to you, that in me you may have peace. In the world you shall have distress. But have confidence. I have overcome the world.`]},"ca-ps-118-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord is my strength and my praise: and he is become my salvation.`],r:[117,14,14]},"ca-josh-1-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`Behold I command thee, take courage, and be strong. Fear not, and be not dismayed: because the Lord thy God is with thee in all things whatsoever thou shalt go to.`]},"ca-isa-41-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`Fear not, for I am with thee: turn not aside, for I am thy God: I have strengthened thee, and have helped thee, and the right hand of my just one hath upheld thee.`]},"ca-mark-6-50":{e:`drc`,t:[`For they all saw him, and were troubled. And immediately he spoke with them, and said to them: Have a good heart, it is I, fear ye not.`]},"ca-2tim-1-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`For God hath not given us the spirit of fear: but of power and of love and of sobriety.`]},"ca-matt-6-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`And forgive us our debts, as we also forgive our debtors.`]},"ca-matt-18-21-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`Then came Peter unto him and said: Lord, how often shall my brother offend against me, and I forgive him? till seven times?`,`Jesus saith to him: I say not to thee, till seven times; but till seventy times seven times.`]},"ca-eph-4-32":{e:`drc`,t:[`And be ye kind one to another: merciful, forgiving one another, even as God hath forgiven you in Christ.`]},"ca-col-3-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Bearing with one another and forgiving one another, if any have a complaint against another. Even as the Lord hath forgiven you, so do you also.`]},"ca-sir-28-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Forgive thy neighbour if he hath hurt thee: and then shall thy sins be forgiven to thee when thou prayest.`]},"ca-luke-6-37":{e:`drc`,t:[`Judge not: and you shall not be judged. Condemn not: and you shall not be condemned. Forgive: and you shall be forgiven.`]},"ca-jas-1-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`But if any of you want wisdom, let him ask of God who giveth to all men abundantly and upbraideth not. And it shall be given him.`]},"ca-wis-7-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Wherefore I wished, and understanding was given me: and I called upon God, and the spirit of wisdom came upon me:`]},"ca-wis-6-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`Wisdom is glorious, and never fadeth away, and is easily seen by them that love her, and is found by them that seek her.`],r:[6,13,13]},"ca-prov-19-20":{e:`drc`,t:[`Hear counsel, and receive instruction, that thou mayst be wise in thy latter end.`]},"ca-sir-5-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be meek to hear the word, that thou mayst understand: and return a true answer with wisdom.`],r:[5,13,13]},"ca-prov-14-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`The innocent believeth every word: the discreet man considereth his steps. No good shall come to the deceitful son: but the wise servant shall prosper in his dealings, and his way shall be made straight.`]},"ca-acts-20-35":{e:`drc`,t:[`I have shewed you all things, how that so labouring you ought to support the weak and to remember the word of the Lord Jesus, how he said: It is a more blessed thing to give, rather than to receive.`]},"ca-2cor-9-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Every one as he hath determined in his heart, not with sadness or of necessity: for God loveth a cheerful giver.`]},"ca-luke-3-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`And he answering, said to them: He that hath two coats, let him give to him that hath none; and he that hath meat, let him do in like manner.`]},"ca-tob-4-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Give alms out of thy substance, and turn not away thy face from any poor person: for so it shall come to pass that the face of the Lord shall not be turned from thee.`]},"ca-matt-6-3-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`But when thou dost alms, let not thy left hand know what thy right hand doth.`,`That thy alms may be in secret, and thy Father who seeth in secret will repay thee.`]},"ca-1jn-3-17-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that hath the substance of this world and shall see his brother in need and shall shut up his bowels from him: how doth the charity of God abide in him?`,`My little children, let us not love in word nor in tongue, but in deed and in truth.`]},"ca-sir-18-30":{e:`drc`,t:[`Go not after thy lusts, but turn away from thy own will.`]},"ca-sir-5-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Follow not in thy strength the desires of thy heart:`]},"ca-titus-2-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`Instructing us, that, denying ungodliness and worldly desires, we should live soberly and justly and godly in this world,`]},"ca-prov-16-32":{e:`drc`,t:[`The patient man is better than the valiant: and he that ruleth his spirit, than he that taketh cities.`]},"ca-gal-5-22-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`But the fruit of the Spirit is, charity, joy, peace, patience, benignity, goodness, longanimity,`,`Mildness, faith, modesty, continency, chastity. Against such there is no law.`]},"ca-jas-1-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`You know, my dearest brethren. And let every man be swift to hear, but slow to speak and slow to anger.`]},"ca-col-3-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`Whatsoever you do, do it from the heart, as to the Lord, and not to men:`]},"ca-gal-6-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`And in doing good, let us not fail. For in due time we shall reap, not failing.`]},"ca-luke-16-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that is faithful in that which is least is faithful also in that which is greater: and he that is unjust in that which is little is unjust also in that which is greater.`]},"ca-sir-11-20":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be steadfast in thy covenant, and be conversant therein, and grow old in the work of thy commandments.`],r:[11,21,21]},"ca-prov-6-6-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`Go to the ant, O sluggard, and consider her ways, and learn wisdom:`,`Which, although she hath no guide, nor master, nor captain,`,`Provideth her meat for herself in the summer, and gathereth her food in the harvest.`]},"ca-1cor-15-58":{e:`drc`,t:[`Therefore, my beloved brethren, be ye steadfast and unmoveable: always abounding in the work of the Lord, knowing that your labour is not in vain in the Lord.`]},"ca-rom-12-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`Rejoicing in hope. Patient in tribulation. Instant in prayer.`]},"ca-sir-2-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Take all that shall be brought upon thee: and in thy sorrow endure, and in thy humiliation keep patience.`]},"ca-ps-37-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be subject to the Lord and pray to him. Envy not the man who prospereth in his way; the man who doth unjust things.`],r:[36,7,7]},"ca-1cor-13-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Charity is patient, is kind: charity envieth not, dealeth not perversely, is not puffed up,`]},"ca-eccl-7-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`Better is the end of a speech than the beginning. Better is the patient man than the presumptuous.`],r:[7,9,9]},"ca-eph-4-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`With all humility and mildness, with patience, supporting one another in charity.`]},"ca-matt-5-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`Blessed are the peacemakers: for they shall be called the children of God.`]},"ca-john-14-27":{e:`drc`,t:[`Peace I leave with you: my peace I give unto you: not as the world giveth, do I give unto you. Let not your heart be troubled: nor let it be afraid.`]},"ca-phil-4-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`And the peace of God, which surpasseth all understanding, keep your hearts and minds in Christ Jesus.`]},"ca-rom-12-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`If it be possible, as much as is in you, have peace with all men.`]},"ca-isa-26-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`The old error is passed away: thou wilt keep peace: peace, because we have hoped in thee.`]},"ca-2cor-1-3-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, the Father of mercies and the God of all comfort:`,`Who comforteth us in all our tribulation, that we also may be able to comfort them who are in all distress, by the exhortation wherewith we also are exhorted by God.`]},"ca-matt-5-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Blessed are they that mourn: for they shall be comforted.`],r:[5,5,5]},"ca-matt-11-28":{e:`drc`,t:[`Come to me all you that labor and are burdened, and I will refresh you.`]},"ca-isa-66-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`As one whom the mother caresseth, so will I comfort you, and you shall be comforted in Jerusalem.`]},"ca-ps-147-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`Who healeth the broken of heart, and bindeth up their bruises.`],r:[146,3,3]},"ca-1pet-5-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Casting all your care upon him, for he hath care of you.`]},"ca-rom-5-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`And hope confoundeth not: because the charity of God is poured forth in our hearts, by the Holy Ghost who is given to us.`]},"ca-heb-10-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let us hold fast the confession of our hope without wavering (for he is faithful that hath promised):`]},"ca-heb-6-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`Which we have as an anchor of the soul, sure and firm, and which entereth in even within the veil:`]},"ca-rom-15-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Now the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace in believing: that you may abound in hope and in the power of the Holy Ghost.`]},"ca-lam-3-21-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`Zain. These things I shall think over in my heart, therefore will I hope.`,`Heth. The mercies of the Lord that we are not consumed: because his commiserations have not failed.`,`Heth. They are new every morning, great is thy faithfulness.`]},"ca-isa-40-31":{e:`drc`,t:[`But they that hope in the Lord shall renew their strength, they shall take wings as eagles, they shall run and not be weary, they shall walk and not faint.`]},"ca-ps-136-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Alleluia. Praise the Lord, for he is good: for his mercy endureth for ever.`],r:[135,1,1]},"ca-ps-103-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Bless the Lord, O my soul, and never forget all he hath done for thee.`],r:[102,2,2]},"ca-ps-118-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`This is the day which the Lord hath made: let us be glad and rejoice therein.`],r:[117,24,24]},"ca-col-2-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Rooted and built up in him and confirmed in the faith, as also you have learned: abounding in him in thanksgiving.`]},"ca-prov-27-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let another praise thee, and not thy own mouth: a stranger, and not thy own lips.`]},"ca-rom-12-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Being of one mind one towards another. Not minding high things, but consenting to the humble. Be not wise in your own conceits.`]},"ca-1pet-5-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`In like manner, ye young men, be subject to the ancients. And do you all insinuate humility one to another: for God resisteth the proud, but to the humble he giveth grace.`]},"ca-sir-3-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`My son, do thy works in meekness, and thou shalt be beloved above the glory of men.`],r:[3,19,19]},"ca-heb-13-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`So that we may confidently say: The Lord is my helper: I will not fear what man shall do to me.`]},"ca-1chr-28-20":{e:`drc`,t:[`And David said to Solomon his son: Act like a man, and take courage, and do: fear not, and be not dismayed: for the Lord my God will be with thee, and will not leave thee, nor forsake thee, till thou hast finished all the work for the service of the house of the Lord.`]},"ca-ps-27-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`The psalm of David before he was anointed. The Lord is my light and my salvation, whom shall I fear? The Lord is the protector of my life: of whom shall I be afraid?`],r:[26,1,1]},"ca-isa-43-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`When thou shalt pass through the waters, I will be with thee, and the rivers shall not cover thee: when thou shalt walk in the fire, thou shalt not be burnt, and the flames shall not burn in thee:`]},"ca-mark-11-25":{e:`drc`,t:[`And when you shall stand to pray, forgive, if you have aught against any man: that your Father also, who is in heaven, may forgive you your sins.`]},"ca-prov-19-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`The learning of a man is known by patience: and his glory is to pass over wrongs.`]},"ca-1pet-4-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`But before all things have a constant mutual charity among yourselves: for charity covereth a multitude of sins.`]},"ca-luke-17-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`And if he sin against thee seven times in a day, and seven times in a day be converted unto thee, saying: I repent: forgive him.`]},"ca-prov-3-5-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Have confidence in the Lord with all thy heart, and lean not upon thy own prudence.`,`In all thy ways think on him, and he will direct thy steps.`]},"ca-prov-15-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`A mild answer breaketh wrath: but a harsh word stirreth up fury.`]},"ca-prov-13-20":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that walketh with the wise, shall be wise: a friend of fools shall become like to them.`]},"ca-eccl-3-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`All things have their season, and in their times all things pass under heaven.`]},"ca-heb-13-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`And do not forget to do good and to impart: for by such sacrifices God's favour is obtained.`]},"ca-luke-6-38":{e:`drc`,t:[`Give: and it shall be given to you: good measure and pressed down and shaken together and running over shall they give into your bosom. For with the same measure that you shall mete withal, it shall be measured to you again.`]},"ca-prov-3-27":{e:`drc`,t:[`Do not withhold him from doing good, who is able: if thou art able, do good thyself also.`]},"ca-gal-6-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Bear ye one another's burdens: and so you shall fulfil the law of Christ.`]},"ca-prov-25-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Thou hast found honey, eat what is sufficient for thee, lest being glutted therewith thou vomit it up.`]},"ca-1tim-6-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`But godliness with contentment is great gain.`]},"ca-heb-13-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let your manners be without covetousness, contented with such things as you have. For he hath said: I will not leave thee: neither will I forsake thee.`]},"ca-prov-21-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that keepeth his mouth and his tongue, keepeth his soul from distress.`]},"ca-prov-10-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`The slothful hand hath wrought poverty: but the hand of the industrious getteth riches. He that trusteth to lies feedeth the winds: and the same runneth after birds, that fly away.`]},"ca-prov-22-29":{e:`drc`,t:[`Hast thou seen a man swift in his work? he shall stand before kings, and shall not be before those that are obscure.`]},"ca-prov-12-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`The hand of the valiant shall bear rule: but that which is slothful shall be under tribute.`]},"ca-2thess-3-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`But you, brethren, be not weary in well doing.`]},"ca-rom-5-3-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`And not only so: but we glory also in tribulation, knowing that tribulation worketh patience;`,`And patience trial; and trial hope;`]},"ca-jas-1-2-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`My brethren, count it all joy, when you shall fall into divers temptations:`,`Knowing that the trying of your faith worketh patience`]},"ca-lam-3-25-26":{e:`drc`,t:[`Teth. The Lord is good to them that hope in him, to the soul that seeketh him.`,`Teth. It is good to wait with silence for the salvation of God.`]},"ca-col-1-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Strengthened with all might according to the power of his glory, in all patience and longsuffering with joy,`]},"ca-ps-23-1-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`A psalm for David. The Lord ruleth me: and I shall want nothing.`,`He hath set me in a place of pasture. He hath brought me up, on the water of refreshment:`],r:[22,1,2]},"ca-num-6-24-26":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord bless thee, and keep thee.`,`The Lord shew his face to thee, and have mercy on thee.`,`The Lord turn his countenance to thee, and give thee peace.`]},"ca-2thess-3-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Now the Lord of peace himself give you everlasting peace in every place. The Lord be with you all.`]},"ca-ps-131-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`If I was not humbly minded, but exalted my soul: As a child that is weaned is towards his mother, so reward in my soul.`],r:[130,2,2]},"ca-phil-4-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`I can do all things in him who strengtheneth me.`]},"ca-matt-6-34":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be not therefore solicitous for to morrow; for the morrow will be solicitous for itself. Sufficient for the day is the evil thereof.`]},"ca-isa-40-29":{e:`drc`,t:[`It is he that giveth strength to the weary, and increaseth force and might to them that are not.`]},"ca-2cor-12-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`And he said to me: My grace is sufficient for thee: for power is made perfect in infirmity. Gladly therefore will I glory in my infirmities, that the power of Christ may dwell in me.`]},"ca-isa-49-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`Can a woman forget her infant, so as not to have pity on the son of her womb? and if she should forget, yet will not I forget thee.`]},"ca-rom-8-28":{e:`drc`,t:[`And we know that to them that love God all things work together unto good: to such as, according to his purpose, are called to be saints.`]},"ca-isa-43-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`Behold I do new things, and now they shall spring forth, verily you shall know them: I will make a way in the wilderness, and rivers in the desert.`]},"ca-heb-11-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Now, faith is the substance of things to be hoped for, the evidence of things that appear not.`]},"ca-jer-29-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`For I know the thoughts that I think towards you, saith the Lord, thoughts of peace, and not of affliction, to give you an end and patience.`]},"ca-ps-95-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let us come before his presence with thanksgiving; and make a joyful noise to him with psalms.`],r:[94,2,2]},"ca-ps-138-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`For David himself. I will praise thee, O Lord, with my whole heart: for thou hast heard the words of my mouth. I will sing praise to thee in the sight of the angels:`],r:[137,1,1]},"ca-ps-126-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord hath done great things for us: we are become joyful.`],r:[125,3,3]},"ca-tob-12-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Then he said to them secretly, Bless ye the God of heaven, give glory to him in the sight of all that live, because he hath shewn his mercy to you.`]},"ca-col-3-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`All whatsoever you do in word or in work, do all in the name of the Lord Jesus Christ, giving thanks to God and the Father by him.`]},"ca-1th-5-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Always rejoice.`]},"ca-ps-28-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord is my helper and my protector: in him hath my heart confided, and I have been helped. And my flesh hath flourished again, and with my will I will give praise to him.`],r:[27,7,7]},"ca-hab-3-17-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`For the fig tree shall not blossom: and there shall be no spring in the vines. The labour of the olive tree shall fail: and the fields shall yield no food: the flock shall be cut off from the fold, and there shall be no herd in the stalls.`,`But I will rejoice in the Lord: and I will joy in God my Jesus.`]},"ca-prov-16-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`Pride goeth before destruction: and the spirit is lifted up before a fall.`]},"ca-prov-15-33":{e:`drc`,t:[`The fear of the Lord is the lesson of wisdom: and humility goeth before glory.`]},"ca-jas-4-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`But he giveth greater grace. Wherefore he saith: God resisteth the proud and giveth grace to the humble.`]},"ca-phil-2-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Each one not considering the things that are his own, but those that are other men's.`]},"ca-gal-6-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`For if any man think himself to be some thing, whereas he is nothing, he deceiveth himself.`]},"ca-rom-12-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`For I say, by the grace that is given me, to all that are among you, not to be more wise than it behoveth to be wise, but to be wise unto sobriety and according as God hath divided to every one the measure of faith.`]},"ca-prov-29-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`Humiliation followeth the proud: and glory shall uphold the humble of spirit.`]},"ca-matt-5-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Blessed are the meek: for they shall possess the land.`],r:[5,4,4]},"ca-acts-18-9-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`And the Lord said to Paul in the night, by a vision: Do not fear, but speak. And hold not thy peace,`,`Because I am with thee and no man shall set upon thee, to hurt thee. For I have much people in this city.`]},"ca-isa-43-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`And now thus saith the Lord that created thee, O Jacob, and formed thee, O Israel: Fear not, for I have redeemed thee, and called thee by thy name: thou art mine.`]},"ca-ps-118-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord is my helper: I will not fear what man can do unto me.`],r:[117,6,6]},"ca-eph-6-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`Finally, brethren, be strengthened in the Lord and in the might of his power.`]},"ca-isa-12-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Behold, God is my saviour, I will deal confidently, and will not fear: because the Lord is my strength, and my praise, and he is become my salvation.`]},"ca-ps-121-1-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`I have lifted up my eyes to the mountains, from whence help shall come to me.`,`My help is from the Lord, who made heaven and earth.`],r:[120,1,2]},"ca-prov-28-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`The wicked man fleeth, when no man pursueth: but the just, bold as a lion, shall be without dread.`]},"ca-matt-14-27":{e:`drc`,t:[`And immediately Jesus spoke to them, saying: Be of good heart: it is I, fear ye not.`]},"ca-matt-6-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`For if you will forgive men their offences, your heavenly Father will forgive you also your offences.`]},"ca-eph-4-26":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be angry: and sin not. Let not the sun go down upon your anger.`]},"ca-rom-12-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`To no man rendering evil for evil. Providing good things, not only in the sight of God but also in the sight of all men.`]},"ca-rom-12-21":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be not overcome by evil: but overcome evil by good.`]},"ca-1pet-3-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`Not rendering evil for evil, nor railing for railing, but contrariwise, blessing: for unto this are you called, that you may inherit a blessing.`]},"ca-prov-24-29":{e:`drc`,t:[`Say not: I will do to him as he hath done to me: I will render to every one according to his work.`]},"ca-matt-5-23-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`If therefore thou offer thy gift at the altar, and there thou remember that thy brother hath anything against thee;`,`Leave there thy offering before the altar, and go first to be reconciled to thy brother, and then coming thou shalt offer thy gift.`]},"ca-ps-103-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`As far as the east is from the west, so far hath he removed our iniquities from us.`],r:[102,12,12]},"ca-prov-1-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`A wise man shall hear, and shall be wiser: and he that understandeth shall possess governments.`]},"ca-prov-9-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom: and the knowledge of the holy is prudence.`]},"ca-prov-18-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`A wise heart shall acquire knowledge: and the ear of the wise seeketh instruction.`]},"ca-eccl-4-9-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`It is better therefore that two should be together, than one: for they have the advantage of their society:`,`If one fall he shall be supported by the other: woe to him that is alone, for when he falleth, he hath none to lift him up.`]},"ca-prov-27-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`Iron sharpeneth iron, so a man sharpeneth the countenance of his friend.`]},"ca-prov-4-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`With all watchfulness keep thy heart, because life issueth out from it.`]},"ca-col-4-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let your speech be always in grace seasoned with salt: that you may know how you ought to answer every man.`]},"ca-sir-6-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`A faithful friend is a strong defence: and he that hath found him, hath found a treasure.`]},"ca-prov-22-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that is inclined to mercy, shall be blessed: for of his bread he hath given to the poor. He that maketh presents, shall purchase victory and honour: but he carrieth away the souls of the receivers.`]},"ca-deut-15-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`There will not be wanting poor in the land of thy habitation: therefore I command thee to open thy hand to thy needy and poor brother, that liveth in the land.`]},"ca-isa-58-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`When thou shalt pour out thy soul to the hungry, and shalt satisfy the afflicted soul, then shall thy light rise up in darkness, and thy darkness shall be as the noonday.`]},"ca-rom-12-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Communicating to the necessities of the saints. Pursuing hospitality.`]},"ca-heb-13-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`And hospitality do not forget: for by this some, being not aware of it, have entertained angels.`]},"ca-1pet-4-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`Using hospitality one towards another, without murmuring,`]},"ca-tob-12-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`Prayer is good with fasting and alms more than to lay up treasures of gold.`]},"ca-prov-11-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`Some distribute their own goods, and grow richer: others take away what is not their own, and are always in want.`]},"ca-1cor-9-25":{e:`drc`,t:[`And every one that striveth for the mastery refraineth himself from all things. And they indeed that they may receive a corruptible crown: but we an incorruptible one.`]},"ca-prov-14-30":{e:`drc`,t:[`Soundness of heart is the life of the flesh: but envy is the rottenness of the bones.`]},"ca-prov-23-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Labour not to be rich: but set bounds to thy prudence.`]},"ca-eccl-5-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`A covetous man shall not be satisfied with money: and he that loveth riches shall reap no fruit from them: so this also is vanity.`]},"ca-prov-10-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`In the multitude of words there shall not want sin: but he that refraineth his lips, is most wise.`]},"ca-phil-4-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let your modesty be known to all men. The Lord is nigh.`]},"ca-luke-12-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`And he said to them: Take heed and beware of all covetousness: for a man's life doth not consist in the abundance of things which he possesseth.`]},"ca-prov-17-27":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that setteth bounds to his words, is knowing and wise: and the man of understanding is of a precious spirit.`]},"ca-2tim-2-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`Carefully study to present thyself approved unto God, a workman that needeth not to be ashamed, rightly handling the word of truth.`]},"ca-prov-14-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`In much work there shall be abundance: but where there are many words, there is oftentimes want.`]},"ca-prov-12-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that tilleth his land shall be satisfied with bread: but he that pursueth idleness is very foolish.`]},"ca-eccl-11-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`In the morning sow thy seed, and in the evening let not thy hand cease: for thou knowest not which may rather spring up, this or that: and if both together, it shall be the better.`]},"ca-rom-12-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`In carefulness not slothful. In spirit fervent. Serving the Lord.`]},"ca-matt-25-21":{e:`drc`,t:[`His lord said to him: Well done, good and faithful servant, because thou hast been faithful over a few things, I will place thee over many things. Enter thou into the joy of thy lord.`]},"ca-prov-27-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be diligent to know the countenance of thy cattle, and consider thy own flocks:`]},"ca-1cor-10-31":{e:`drc`,t:[`Therefore, whether you eat or drink, or whatsoever else you do, do all to the glory of God.`]},"ca-heb-12-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`And therefore we also having so great a cloud of witnesses over our head, laying aside every weight and sin which surrounds us, let us run by patience to the fight proposed to us:`]},"ca-isa-30-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`For thus saith the Lord God the Holy One of Israel: If you return and be quiet, you shall be saved: in silence and in hope shall your strength be. And you would not:`]},"ca-hab-2-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`For as yet the vision is far off, and it shall appear at the end, and shall not lie: if it make any delay, wait for it: for it shall surely come, and it shall not be slack.`]},"ca-heb-10-36":{e:`drc`,t:[`For patience is necessary for you: that, doing the will of God, you may receive the promise.`]},"ca-col-3-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`Put ye on therefore, as the elect of God, holy and beloved, the bowels of mercy, benignity, humility, modesty, patience:`]},"ca-prov-25-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`By patience a prince shall be appeased, and a soft tongue shall break hardness.`]},"ca-eccl-7-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be not quickly angry: for anger resteth in the bosom of a fool.`],r:[7,10,10]},"ca-1th-5-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`And we beseech you, brethren, rebuke the unquiet: comfort the feeble minded: support the weak: be patient towards all men.`]},"ca-ps-29-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord will give strength to his people: the Lord will bless his people with peace.`],r:[28,11,11]},"ca-ps-91-1-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`The praise of a canticle for David. He that dwelleth in the aid of the most High, shall abide under the protection of the God of Jacob.`,`He shall say to the Lord: Thou art my protector, and my refuge: my God, in him will I trust.`],r:[90,1,2]},"ca-2cor-13-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`For the rest, brethren, rejoice, be perfect, take exhortation, be of one mind, have peace. And the God of grace and of love shall be with you.`]},"ca-isa-32-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`And the work of justice shall be peace, and the service of justice quietness, and security for ever.`]},"ca-ps-4-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`In peace in the self same I will sleep, and I will rest:`]},"ca-ps-119-165":{e:`drc`,t:[`Much peace have they that love thy law, and to them there is no stumbling block.`],r:[118,165,165]},"ca-isa-54-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`For the mountains shall be moved, and the hills shall tremble; but my mercy shall not depart from thee, and the covenant of my peace shall not be moved: said the Lord that hath mercy on thee.`]},"ca-ps-16-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`I set the Lord always in my sight: for he is at my right hand, that I be not moved.`],r:[15,8,8]},"ca-isa-41-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`For I am the Lord thy God, who take thee by the hand, and say to thee: Fear not, I have helped thee.`]},"ca-sir-30-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`The joyfulness of the heart, is the life of a man, and a never failing treasure of holiness: and the joy of a man is length of life.`],r:[30,23,23]},"ca-sir-7-34":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be not wanting in comforting them that weep, and walk with them that mourn.`],r:[7,38,38]},"ca-ps-73-26":{e:`drc`,t:[`For thee my flesh and my heart hath fainted away: thou art the God of my heart, and the God that is my portion for ever.`],r:[72,26,26]},"ca-john-14-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let not your heart be troubled. You believe in God: believe also in me.`]},"ca-2cor-4-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`For which cause we faint not: but though our outward man is corrupted, yet the inward man is renewed day by day.`]},"ca-ps-94-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`According to the multitude of my sorrows in my heart, thy comforts have given joy to my soul.`],r:[93,19,19]},"ca-prov-17-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`A joyful mind maketh age flourishing: a sorrowful spirit drieth up the bones.`]},"ca-sir-2-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Believe God, and he will recover thee: and direct thy way, and trust in him. Keep his fear, and grow old therein.`]},"ca-wis-11-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`For thou lovest all things that are, and hatest none of the things which thou hast made: for thou didst not appoint, or make any thing hating it.`],r:[11,25,25]},"ca-ps-130-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`my soul hath hoped in the Lord.`],r:[129,5,5]},"ca-mic-7-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`But I will look towards the Lord, I will wait for God, my saviour: my God will hear me.`]},"ca-phil-1-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Being confident of this very thing: that he who hath begun a good work in you will perfect it unto the day of Christ Jesus.`]},"ca-prov-13-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`Hope that is deferred afflicteth the soul: desire when it cometh, is a tree of life.`]},"ca-1cor-13-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`And now there remain faith, hope, and charity, these three: but the greatest of these is charity.`]},"ca-ps-71-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`But I will always hope; and will add to all thy praise.`],r:[70,14,14]},"ca-prov-3-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let not mercy aud truth leave thee, put them about thy neck, and write them in the tables of thy heart.`]},"ca-eph-4-29":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let no evil speech proceed from your mouth: but that which is good, to the edification of faith: that it may administer grace to the hearers.`]},"ca-prov-16-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`Lay open thy works to the Lord: and thy thoughts shall be directed.`]},"ca-ps-37-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Commit thy way to the Lord, and trust in him, and he will do it.`],r:[36,5,5]},"ca-ps-111-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`I will praise thee, O Lord, with my whole heart; in the council of the just, and in the congregation.`],r:[110,1,1]},"ca-ps-145-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord is sweet to all: and his tender mercies are over all his works.`],r:[144,9,9]},"ca-ps-147-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Sing ye to the Lord with praise: sing to our God upon the harp.`],r:[146,7,7]},"ca-ps-104-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`How great are thy works, O Lord? thou hast made all things in wisdom: the earth is filled with thy riches.`],r:[103,24,24]},"ca-2cor-9-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`Thanks be to God for his unspeakable gift.`]},"ca-1tim-4-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`For every creature of God is good, and nothing to be rejected that is received with thanksgiving:`]},"ca-luke-17-15-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`And one of them, when he saw that he was made clean, went back, with a loud voice glorifying God.`,`And he fell on his face before his feet, giving thanks. And this was a Samaritan.`]},"ca-jas-1-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`Every best gift and every perfect gift is from above, coming down from the Father of lights, with whom there is no change nor shadow of alteration.`]},"ca-prov-18-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`Before destruction, the heart of a man is exalted: and before he be glorified, it is humbled.`]},"ca-prov-16-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`It is better to be humbled with the meek, than to divide spoils with the proud.`]},"ca-1pet-5-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be you humbled therefore under the mighty hand of God, that he may exalt you in the time of visitation:`]},"ca-mark-9-35":{e:`drc`,t:[`And sitting down, he called the twelve and saith to them: If any man desire to be first, he shall be the last of all and be minister of all.`],r:[9,34,34]},"ca-john-13-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`If then I being your Lord and Master, have washed your feet; you also ought to wash one another's feet.`]},"ca-jas-3-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Who is a wise man and endued with knowledge, among you? Let him shew, by a good contestation, his work in the meekness of wisdom.`]},"ca-rom-12-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`Loving one another with the charity of brotherhood: with honour preventing one another.`]},"ca-matt-18-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Whosoever therefore shall humble himself as this little child, he is the greater in the kingdom of heaven.`]},"ca-deut-31-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`And the Lord who is your leader, he himself will be with thee: he will not leave thee, nor forsake thee: fear not, neither be dismayed.`]},"ca-2chr-15-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Do you therefore take courage, and let not your hands be weakened: for there shall be a reward for your work.`]},"ca-acts-27-25":{e:`drc`,t:[`Wherefore, sirs, be of good cheer: for I believe God, that it shall so be, as it hath been told me.`]},"ca-ps-27-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`Expect the Lord, do manfully, and let thy heart take courage, and wait thou for the Lord.`],r:[26,14,14]},"ca-heb-4-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let us go therefore with confidence to the throne of grace: that we may obtain mercy and find grace in seasonable aid.`]},"ca-mark-9-23":{e:`drc`,t:[`And Jesus saith to him: If thou canst believe, all things are possible to him that believeth.`],r:[9,22,22]},"ca-ps-112-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`The just shall be in everlasting remembrance: he shall not fear the evil hearing. His heart is ready to hope in the Lord:`],r:[111,7,7]},"ca-josh-1-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Take courage therefore, and be very valiant: that thou mayst observe and do all the law, which Moses my servant hath commanded thee: turn not from it to the right hand or to the left, that thou mayst understand all things which thou dost.`]},"ca-matt-5-44":{e:`drc`,t:[`But I say to you, Love your enemies: do good to them that hate you: and pray for them that persecute and calumniate you:`]},"ca-prov-20-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`Say not: I will return evil: wait for the Lord, and he will deliver thee.`]},"ca-1cor-13-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Is not ambitious, seeketh not her own, is not provoked to anger, thinketh no evil:`]},"ca-2cor-2-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`So that on the contrary, you should rather forgive him and comfort him, lest perhaps such a one be swallowed up with overmuch sorrow.`]},"ca-ps-86-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`For thou, O Lord, art sweet and mild: and plenteous in mercy to all that call upon thee.`],r:[85,5,5]},"ca-eph-4-31":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let all bitterness and anger and indignation and clamour and blasphemy be put away from you, with all malice.`]},"ca-1jn-1-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`If we confess our sins, he is faithful and just, to forgive us our sins and to cleanse us from all iniquity.`]},"ca-jas-5-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Confess therefore your sins one to another: and pray one for another, that you may be saved. For the continual prayer of a just man availeth much.`]},"ca-prov-17-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that concealeth a transgression, seeketh friendships: he that repeateth it again, separateth friends.`]},"ca-prov-2-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Because the Lord giveth wisdom: and out of his mouth cometh prudence and knowledge.`]},"ca-prov-4-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`The beginning of wisdom, get wisdom, and with all thy possession purchase prudence.`]},"ca-prov-15-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`Designs are brought to nothing where there is no counsel: but where there are many counsellors, they are established.`]},"ca-prov-20-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Counsel in the heart of a man is like deep water: but a wise man will draw it out.`]},"ca-prov-18-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that answereth before he heareth, sheweth himself to be a fool, and worthy of confusion.`]},"ca-ps-119-105":{e:`drc`,t:[`Thy word is a lamp to my feet, and a light to my paths.`],r:[118,105,105]},"ca-ps-32-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`I will give thee understanding, and I will instruct thee in this way, in which thou shalt go: I will fix my eyes upon thee.`],r:[31,8,8]},"ca-matt-7-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`Every one therefore that heareth these my words, and doth them, shall be likened to a wise man that built his house upon a rock,`]},"ca-prov-16-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Get wisdom, because it is better than gold: and purchase prudence, for it is more precious than silver.`]},"ca-2cor-9-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`Now this I say: He who soweth sparingly shall also reap sparingly: and he who soweth in blessings shall also reap blessings.`]},"ca-1tim-6-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`To do good, to be rich in good work, to give easily, to communicate to others,`]},"ca-isa-58-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Deal thy bread to the hungry, and bring the needy and the harbourless into thy house: when thou shalt see one naked, cover him, and despise not thy own flesh.`]},"ca-deut-15-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`But thou shalt give to him: neither shalt thou do any thing craftily in relieving his necessities: that the Lord thy God may bless thee at all times, and in all things to which thou shalt put thy hand.`]},"ca-prov-14-21":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that despiseth his neighbour, sinneth: but he that sheweth mercy to the poor, shall be blessed. He that believeth in the Lord, loveth mercy.`]},"ca-1pet-4-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`As every man hath received grace, ministering the same one to another: as good stewards of the manifold grace of God.`]},"ca-gal-6-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`Therefore, whilst we have time, let us work good to all men, but especially to those who are of the household of the faith.`]},"ca-heb-6-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`For God is not unjust, that he should forget your work and the love which you have shewn in his name, you who have ministered and do minister to the saints.`]},"ca-1tim-6-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`But having food and wherewith to be covered, with these we are content.`]},"ca-1th-4-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`And that you use your endeavour to be quiet: and that you do your own business and work with your own hands, as we commanded you: and that you walk honestly towards them that are without: and that you want nothing of any man's.`]},"ca-rom-13-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let us walk honestly, as in the day: not in rioting and drunkenness, not in chambering and impurities, not in contention and envy.`]},"ca-eph-5-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`And be not drunk with wine, wherein is luxury: but be ye filled with the Holy Spirit,`]},"ca-prov-17-28":{e:`drc`,t:[`Even a fool, if he will hold his peace, shall be counted wise: and if he close his lips, a man of understanding.`]},"ca-jas-3-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Even so the tongue is indeed a little member and boasteth great things. Behold how small a fire kindleth a great wood.`]},"ca-1cor-6-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`All things are lawful to me: but all things are not expedient. All things are lawful to me: but I will not be brought under the power of any.`]},"ca-phil-4-11-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`I speak not as it were for want. For I have learned, in whatsoever state I am, to be content therewith.`,`I know both how to be brought low, and I know how to abound (every where and in all things I am instructed): both to be full and to be hungry: both to abound and to suffer need.`]},"ca-prov-10-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that walketh sincerely, walketh confidently: but he that perverteth his ways, shall be manifest.`]},"ca-prov-12-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`Lying lips are an abomination to the Lord: but they that deal faithfully, please him.`]},"ca-matt-5-37":{e:`drc`,t:[`But let your speech be yea, yea: no, no: and that which is over and above these, is of evil.`]},"ca-1cor-4-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Here now it is required among the dispensers that a man be found faithful.`]},"ca-2cor-8-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Now therefore perform ye it also in deed: that as your mind is forward to be willing, so it may be also to perform, out of that which you have.`]},"ca-ps-15-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that walketh without blemish, and worketh justice:`],r:[14,2,2]},"ca-zech-8-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`These then are the things, which you shall do: Speak ye truth every one to his neighbour; judge ye truth and judgment of peace in your gates.`]},"ca-jas-1-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`But be ye doers of the word and not hearers only, deceiving your own selves.`]},"ca-prov-21-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`The thoughts of the industrious always bring forth abundance: but every sluggard is always in want.`]},"ca-1cor-13-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Beareth all things, believeth all things, hopeth all things, endureth all things.`]},"ca-jas-5-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Behold, we account them blessed who have endured. You have heard of the patience of Job and you have seen the end of the Lord, that the Lord is merciful and compassionate.`]},"ca-rom-8-25":{e:`drc`,t:[`But if we hope for that which we see not, we wait for it with patience.`]},"ca-heb-6-12":{e:`drc`,t:[`That you become not slothful, but followers of them who through faith and patience shall inherit the promises.`]},"ca-2thess-3-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`And the Lord direct your hearts, in the charity of God and the patience of Christ.`]},"ca-luke-8-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`But that on the good ground are they who in a good and perfect heart, hearing the word, keep it and bring forth fruit in patience.`]},"ca-prov-14-29":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that is patient, is governed with much wisdom: but he that is impatient, exalteth his folly.`]},"ca-heb-6-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`And so patiently enduring he obtained the promise.`]},"ca-rom-14-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`Therefore, let us follow after the things that are of peace and keep the things that are of edification, one towards another.`]},"ca-1pet-3-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let him decline from evil and do good: Let him seek after peace and pursue it:`]},"ca-mark-9-50":{e:`drc`,t:[`Salt is good. But if the salt become unsavoury, wherewith will you season it? Have salt in you: and have peace among you.`],r:[9,49,49]},"ca-prov-15-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`It is better to be invited to herbs with love, than to a fatted calf with hatred.`]},"ca-prov-17-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Better is a dry morsel with joy, than a house full of victims with strife.`]},"ca-jas-3-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`And the fruit of justice is sown in peace, to them that make peace.`]},"ca-ps-116-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Turn, O my soul, into thy rest: for the Lord hath been bountiful to thee.`],r:[114,7,7]},"ca-phil-4-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`The things which you have both learned and received and heard and seen in me, these do ye: and the God of peace shall be with you.`]},"ca-mark-4-39":{e:`drc`,t:[`And rising up, he rebuked the wind, and said to the sea: Peace, be still. And the wind ceased: and there was made a great calm.`]},"ca-rom-12-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`Rejoice with them that rejoice: weep with them that weep.`]},"ca-ps-121-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`May he not suffer thy foot to be moved: neither let him slumber that keepeth thee.`],r:[120,3,3]},"ca-ps-121-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`May the Lord keep thy coming in and thy going out; from henceforth now and for ever.`],r:[120,8,8]},"ca-isa-46-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Even to your old age I am the same, and to your grey hairs I will carry you: I have made you, and I will bear: I will carry and will save.`]},"ca-ps-145-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord lifteth up all that fall: and setteth up all that are cast down.`],r:[144,14,14]},"ca-ps-145-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord is nigh unto all them that call upon him: to all that call upon him in truth.`],r:[144,18,18]},"ca-2cor-7-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`But God, who comforteth the humble, comforted us by the coming of Titus.`]},"ca-isa-49-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Give praise, O ye heavens, and rejoice, O earth, ye mountains, give praise with jubilation: because the Lord hath comforted his people, and will have mercy on his poor ones.`]},"ca-prov-24-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`So also is the doctrine of wisdom to thy soul: which when thou hast found, thou shalt have hope in the end, and thy hope shall not perish.`]},"ca-ps-71-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`For thou art my patience, O Lord: my hope, O Lord, from my youth.`],r:[70,5,5]},"ca-ps-146-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Blessed is he who hath the God of Jacob for his helper, whose hope is in the Lord his God:`],r:[145,5,5]},"ca-ps-147-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord taketh pleasure in them that fear him: and in them that hope in his mercy.`],r:[146,11,11]},"ca-matt-7-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Ask, and it shall be given you: seek, and you shall find: knock, and it shall be opened to you.`]},"ca-luke-1-37":{e:`drc`,t:[`Because no word shall be impossible with God.`]},"ca-phil-3-13-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`Brethren, I do not count myself to have apprehended. But one thing I do: Forgetting the things that are behind and stretching forth myself to those that are before,`,`I press towards the mark, to the prize of the supernal vocation of God in Christ Jesus.`]},"ca-prov-23-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`Because thou shalt have hope in the latter end, and thy expectation shall not be taken away.`]},"ca-ps-100-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`For the Lord is sweet, his mercy endureth for ever, and his truth to generation and generation.`],r:[99,5,5]},"ca-1chr-16-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`Praise ye the Lord, and call upon his name: make known his doings among the nations.`]},"ca-ps-118-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Give praise to the Lord, for he is good: for his mercy endureth for ever.`],r:[117,1,1]},"ca-col-3-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let the word of Christ dwell in you abundantly: in all wisdom, teaching and admonishing one another in psalms, hymns and spiritual canticles, singing in grace in your hearts to God.`]},"ca-heb-12-28":{e:`drc`,t:[`Therefore, receiving an immoveable kingdom, we have grace: whereby let us serve, pleasing God, with fear and reverence.`]},"ca-2cor-4-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`For all things are for your sakes: that the grace, abounding through many, may abound in thanksgiving unto the glory of God.`]},"ca-luke-1-46-47":{e:`drc`,t:[`And Mary said: My soul doth magnify the Lord.`,`And my spirit hath rejoiced in God my Saviour.`]},"ca-prov-3-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Be not wise in thy own conceit: fear God, and depart from evil:`]},"ca-matt-23-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that is the greatest among you shall be your servant.`]},"ca-1cor-4-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`For who distinguisheth thee? Or what hast thou that thou hast not received, and if thou hast received, why dost thou glory, as if thou hadst not received it?`]},"ca-prov-25-6-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Appear not glorious before the king, and stand not in the place of great men.`,`For it is better that it should be said to thee: Come up hither; than that thou shouldst be humbled before the prince.`]},"ca-isa-66-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`My hand made all these things, and all these things were made, saith the Lord. But to whom shall I have respect, but to him that is poor and little, and of a contrite spirit, and that trembleth at my words?`]},"ca-1pet-3-8":{e:`drc`,t:[`And in fine, be ye all of one mind, having compassion one of another, being lovers of the brotherhood, merciful, modest, humble:`]},"ca-prov-15-31":{e:`drc`,t:[`The ear that heareth the reproofs of life, shall abide in the midst of the wise.`]},"ca-1jn-4-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`Fear is not in charity: but perfect charity casteth out fear, because fear hath sin. And he that feareth is not perfected in charity.`]},"ca-matt-10-31":{e:`drc`,t:[`Fear not therefore: better are you than many sparrows.`]},"ca-luke-12-32":{e:`drc`,t:[`Fear not, little flock, for it hath pleased your Father to give you a kingdom.`]},"ca-2cor-4-8-9":{e:`drc`,t:[`In all things we suffer tribulation: but are not distressed. We are straitened: but are not destitute.`,`We suffer persecution: but are not forsaken. We are cast down: but we perish not.`]},"ca-neh-8-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`And he said to them: Go, eat fat meats, and drink sweet wine, and send portions to them that have not prepared for themselves: because it is the holy day of the Lord, and be not sad: for the joy of the Lord is our strength.`]},"ca-acts-23-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`And the night following, the Lord standing by him, said: Be constant: for as thou hast testified of me in Jerusalem, so must thou bear witness also at Rome.`]},"ca-isa-43-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`Fear not, for I am with thee: I will bring thy seed from the east, and gather thee from the west.`]},"ca-luke-15-20":{e:`drc`,t:[`And rising up, he came to his father. And when he was yet a great way off, his father saw him and was moved with compassion and running to him fell upon his neck and kissed him.`]},"ca-mic-7-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`He will turn again, and have mercy on us: he will put away our iniquities: and he will cast all our sins into the bottom of the sea.`]},"ca-ps-32-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`I have acknowledged my sin to thee, and my injustice I have not concealed. I said I will confess against my self my injustice to the Lord: and thou hast forgiven the wickedness of my sin.`],r:[31,5,5]},"ca-ps-103-10":{e:`drc`,t:[`He hath not dealt with us according to our sins: nor rewarded us according to our iniquities.`],r:[102,10,10]},"ca-isa-43-25":{e:`drc`,t:[`I am, I am he that blot out thy iniquities for my own sake, and I will not remember thy sins.`]},"ca-gen-50-20-21":{e:`drc`,t:[`You thought evil against me: but God turned it into good, that he might exalt me, as at present you see, and might save many people.`,`Fear not: I will feed you and your children. And he comforted them, and spoke gently and mildly.`]},"ca-prov-1-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`The fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom. Fools despise wisdom and instruction.`]},"ca-prov-3-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Blessed is the man that findeth wisdom, and is rich in prudence:`]},"ca-prov-11-14":{e:`drc`,t:[`Where there is no governor, the people shall fall: but there is safety where there is much counsel.`]},"ca-prov-19-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Where there is no knowledge of the soul, there is no good: and he that is hasty with his feet shall stumble.`]},"ca-prov-24-5":{e:`drc`,t:[`A wise man is strong: and a knowing man, stout and valiant.`]},"ca-matt-10-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`Behold I send you as sheep in the midst of wolves. Be ye therefore wise as serpents and simple as doves.`]},"ca-matt-5-42":{e:`drc`,t:[`Give to him that asketh of thee, and from him that would borrow of thee turn not away.`]},"ca-rom-15-1-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`Now, we that are stronger ought to bear the infirmities of the weak and not to please ourselves.`,`Let every one of you Please his neighbour unto good, to edification.`]},"ca-prov-14-31":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that oppresseth the poor, upbraideth his maker: but he that hath pity on the poor, honoureth him.`]},"ca-heb-10-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`And let us consider one another, to provoke unto charity and to good works:`]},"ca-1jn-4-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`My dearest, if God hath so loved us, we also ought to love one another.`]},"ca-jas-2-15-16":{e:`drc`,t:[`And if a brother or sister be naked and want daily food:`,`And one of you say to them: Go in peace, be ye warmed and filled; yet give them not those things that are necessary for the body, what shall it profit?`]},"ca-luke-10-36-37":{e:`drc`,t:[`Which of these three, in thy opinion, was neighbour to him that fell among the robbers?`,`But he said: He that shewed mercy to him. And Jesus said to him: Go, and do thou in like manner.`]},"ca-prov-25-27":{e:`drc`,t:[`As it is not good for a man to eat much honey, so he that is a searcher of majesty shall be overwhelmed by glory.`]},"ca-prov-20-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Wine is a luxurious thing, and drunkenness riotous: whosoever is delighted therewith, shall not be wise.`]},"ca-jas-1-26":{e:`drc`,t:[`And if any man think himself to be religious, not bridling his tongue but deceiving his own heart, this man's religion is vain.`]},"ca-prov-21-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`He that loveth good cheer, shall be in want: he that loveth wine, and fat things, shall not be rich.`]},"ca-matt-6-19-20":{e:`drc`,t:[`Lay not up to yourselves treasures on earth: where the rust, and moth consume, and where thieves break through, and steal.`,`But lay up to yourselves treasures in heaven: where neither the rust nor moth doth consume, and where thieves do not break through, nor steal.`]},"ca-2pet-1-5-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`And you, employing all care, minister in your faith, virtue: And in virtue, knowledge:`,`And in knowledge, abstinence: and in abstinence, patience: and in patience, godliness:`]},"ca-prov-22-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`A good name is better than great riches: and good favour is above silver and gold.`]},"ca-neh-6-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`And I sent messengers to them, saying: I am doing a great work, and I cannot come down, lest it be neglected whilst I come, and go down to you.`]},"ca-prov-11-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`A deceitful balance is an abomination before the Lord: and a just weight is his will.`]},"ca-prov-12-19":{e:`drc`,t:[`The lip of truth shall be steadfast for ever: but he that is a hasty witness, frameth a lying tongue.`]},"ca-eph-4-25":{e:`drc`,t:[`Wherefore, putting away lying, speak ye the truth, every man with his neighbour. For we are members one of another.`]},"ca-2tim-2-6":{e:`drc`,t:[`The husbandman that laboureth must first partake of the fruits.`]},"ca-prov-13-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Substance got in haste shall be diminished: but that which by little and little is gathered with the hand, shall increase.`]},"ca-jas-1-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`And patience hath a perfect work: that you may be perfect and entire, failing in nothing.`]},"ca-isa-30-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`Therefore the Lord waiteth that he may have mercy on you: and therefore shall he be exalted sparing you: because the Lord is the God of judgment: blessed are all they that wait for him.`]},"ca-rom-15-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`For what things soever were written were written for our learning: that, through patience and the comfort of the scriptures, we might have hope.`]},"ca-eccl-3-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`He hath made all things good in their time, and hath delivered the world to their consideration, so that man cannot find out the work which God hath made from the beginning to the end.`]},"ca-heb-10-35":{e:`drc`,t:[`Do not therefore lose your confidence which hath a great reward.`]},"ca-1th-1-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`Being mindful of the work of your faith and labour and charity: and of the enduring of the hope of our Lord Jesus Christ before God and our Father.`]},"ca-prov-12-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`The way of a fool is right in his own eyes: but he that is wise hearkeneth unto counsels.`]},"ca-isa-48-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`O that thou hadst hearkened to my commandments: thy peace had been as a river, and thy justice as the waves of the sea,`]},"ca-prov-3-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`If thou sleep, thou shalt not fear: thou shalt rest, and thy sleep shall be sweet.`]},"ca-ps-127-2":{e:`drc`,t:[`It is vain for you to rise before light, rise ye after you have sitten, you that eat the bread of sorrow. When he shall give sleep to his beloved,`],r:[126,2,2]},"ca-matt-6-26":{e:`drc`,t:[`Behold the birds of the air, for they neither sow, nor do they reap, nor gather into barns: and your heavenly Father feedeth them. Are not you of much more value than they?`]},"ca-prov-16-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`When the ways of man shall please the Lord, he will convert even his enemies to peace.`]},"ca-ps-23-3":{e:`drc`,t:[`He hath converted my soul. He hath led me on the paths of justice, for his own name's sake.`],r:[22,3,3]},"ca-matt-6-28-29":{e:`drc`,t:[`And for raiment why are you solicitous? Consider the lilies of the field, how they grow: they labour not, neither do they spin.`,`But I say to you, that not even Solomon in all his glory was arrayed as one of these.`]},"ca-john-14-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`I will not leave you orphans: I will come to you.`]},"ca-1cor-10-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Let no temptation take hold on you, but such as is human. And God is faithful, who will not suffer you to be tempted above that which you are able: but will make also with temptation issue, that you may be able to bear it.`]},"ca-zeph-3-17":{e:`drc`,t:[`The Lord thy God in the midst of thee is mighty, he will save: he will rejoice over thee with gladness, he will be silent in his love, he will be joyful over thee in praise.`]},"ca-jer-31-13":{e:`drc`,t:[`Then shall the virgin rejoice in the dance, the young men and old men together: and I will turn their mourning into joy, and will comfort them, and make them joyful after their sorrow.`]},"ca-john-16-22":{e:`drc`,t:[`So also you now indeed have sorrow: but I will see you again and your heart shall rejoice. And your joy no man shall take from you.`]},"ca-isa-57-15":{e:`drc`,t:[`For thus saith the High and the Eminent that inhabiteth eternity: and his name is Holy, who dwelleth in the high and holy place, and with a contrite and humble spirit, to revive the spirit of the humble, and to revive the heart of the contrite.`]},"ca-lam-3-31-32":{e:`drc`,t:[`Caph. For the Lord will not cast off for ever.`,`Caph. For if he hath cast off, he will also have mercy, according to the multitude of his mercies.`]},"ca-rom-4-18":{e:`drc`,t:[`Who against hope believed in hope; that he might be made the father of many nations, according to that which was said to him: So shall thy seed be.`]},"ca-ps-37-4":{e:`drc`,t:[`Delight in the Lord, and he will give thee the requests of thy heart.`],r:[36,4,4]},"ca-jer-17-7":{e:`drc`,t:[`Blessed be the man that trusteth in the Lord, and the Lord shall be his confidence.`]},"ca-mark-11-24":{e:`drc`,t:[`Therefore I say unto you, all things, whatsoever you ask when ye pray, believe that you shall receive: and they shall come unto you.`]},"ca-isa-60-1":{e:`drc`,t:[`Arise, be enlightened, O Jerusalem: for thy light is come, and the glory of the Lord is risen upon thee.`]},"ca-ps-16-11":{e:`drc`,t:[`Thou hast made known to me the ways of life, thou shalt fill me with joy with thy countenance: at thy right hand are delights even to the end.`],r:[15,11,11]}};export{e as default};